{"id":"5902dd5733446e93","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set.md","title":"ZFC Card6 Uncountable Set","display":"df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set — ZFC Card6 Uncountable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set","58-df-zfc-cardop-uncountable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set — ZFC Card6 Uncountable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-injection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-cardop-uncountable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set — ZFC Card6 Uncountable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"58-df-injection\">58-df-injection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\in V\">\\(\\omega\\in V\\)</span> (set parameter and the standard least infinite ordinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"58-df-injection\">58-df-injection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardopUncountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardopUncountableSet}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}uncountable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow \\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,X,\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}uncountable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow \\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,X,\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}uncountable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopUncountableSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S(X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}uncountable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopUncountableSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S(X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and the standard codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> are now declared; the predicate says precisely that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> admits no injection into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-cardop-uncountable-set</code> is merged here; it used the negated injection-into-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> characterization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injection","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-injection]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injection","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injection}_S$ (injection predicate, see [[58-df-injection]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCardopUncountableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}uncountable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow \\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,X,\\omega)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}uncountable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopUncountableSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCard6UncountableSet}_S(X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1501","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set.md|58-df-zfc-card6-uncountable-set]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f5a60b2c6e668b3e"]}